{'symbol': 'RMD', 'date': '2022-02-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'RESMED ANNOUNCES PARTICIPATION IN THE CITI HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, FEB. 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- RESMED (NYSE: RMD, ASX: RMD) TODAY ANNOUNCED MICK FARRELL, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE CITI HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, FEBRUARY 23, 2022, BEGINNING AT APPROXIMATELY 12:30 P.M. (EASTERN STANDARD TIME) VIA WEBCAST.'}